                    <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-base-content mb-3">Sempai</h2>
                    <p class="text-sm text-base-content/88 leading-relaxed">A Semgrep-shaped query engine with a Tree-sitter spine and enough discipline to survive real code.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-8">
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-base-content font-bold mb-3 text-sm">Contents</h3>
                        <ul class="space-y-2 border-l border-base-content/10 ml-1">
                            <li><a href="#thesis" class="block pl-4 text-xs text-base-content/88 hover:text-accent-ink -ml-[1px] py-1 transition-all">Thesis</a></li>
                            <li><a href="#surface" class="block pl-4 text-xs text-base-content/88 hover:text-accent-ink -ml-[1px] py-1 transition-all">Query Surface</a></li>
                            <li><a href="#engine" class="block pl-4 text-xs text-base-content/88 hover:text-accent-ink -ml-[1px] py-1 transition-all">Execution Model</a></li>
                            <li><a href="#contract" class="block pl-4 text-xs text-base-content/88 hover:text-accent-ink -ml-[1px] py-1 transition-all">Integration Contract</a></li>
                            <li><a href="#observe-integration" class="block pl-4 text-xs text-base-content/82 hover:text-accent-ink -ml-[1px] py-1 transition-all">Observe Integration</a></li>
